License boundaries of the pipeline this repo drives (unchanged from the
upstream projects):

- piper1-gpl (teacher training + export): GPLv3 — its outputs (the ONNX
  voice) are data; the piper-voices collection is distributed via HF under
  each voice's dataset license.
- sanoTTS runtime: MIT. sanoTTS training/G2P side: GPLv3.
- The es_CL voice weights themselves: CC BY-SA 4.0 via the SLR71 dataset
  (see ATTRIBUTION.txt).
